# Stage 6 boat route after a checkpoint respawn (D-075 hold, D-085, D-087;
# was QA's qa_m5_respawn_gelse2_stomp_on_traundl_a, carried on to the
# perch). As wolfgangsee_checkpoint to the respawn on the lantern pontoon
# (Gelse #1 death at 2148, respawn 2208, hold until ~2268). Traundl A is in
# range at the respawn, so it wakes at once and runs ~125 frames ahead of
# its continuous phase (D-087's rule); B, C and the Gelsen wake by the
# scroll. Resi walks to the pontoon's end, hops the bollard (133, press
# 2313) into the water, waits for A at its near end and boards it with a
# held jump-out (press 2803). Gelse #2 closes in during the ride and first
# reaches her after A rests at its far end; a standing full jump (press
# 2907) stomps it and she steers onto the border raft. The edge sweeps the
# raft before B docks again (in this phase B's near berth is off screen),
# so she swims on to B's far berth and jumps out onto B (press 3047), hops
# on at once to C as it docks (running jump, press 3077), rides C to its
# far berth and jumps up onto the Zaunerstollen perch (press 3192). Gelse
# #3 comes up to her there. Under the row-5 Z-box (D-090) a standing jump
# is too short for a stomp, so she walks right clear of the box (to 3239),
# stomps the Gelse with a standing full jump (press 3255, stomp 3294),
# walks back under the box (3319-3330) and bumps it (press 3341, bump
# 3343); the Zaunerstollen comes back to her: 1-up (3439, lives 2 -> 3),
# standing on the perch at the end.
# Hand-measured press windows (only that press shifted, every other input
# at its frame; counted = the replay still passes): bollard hop not
# measured (no timing), jump-out onto A 39 frames (>=, -20..18), Gelse #2
# stomp 8 (-1..6), jump-out onto B 12 (-9..2), B -> C 15 (>=, -2..12),
# C -> perch 18 (>=, -15..2), Gelse #3 stomp 18 (-3..14; the stomp alone
# 22, -6..15), box bump >= 40 (-9..30; later presses run past the
# replay's end before the 1-up).
level  = wolfgangsee
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
expect = deaths=1 dies_at frames=2148..2148 event=Stomped event=ExtraLife lives=3 player_y>=106 player_y<=106
